+Implemented RFC 6902 JSON Patch support:
+
+- exported `applyPatch(document, patch)` with all six operations;
+- validated operation members, pointers, array indexes, source/target existence, move ancestry, and
+  RFC JSON equality for `test`;
+- isolated application from caller-owned inputs so an error leaves the source unchanged;
+- added RFC operation, edge-case, and failure tests and documented the public API.
